1
00:00:04,671 --> 00:00:05,714
Chiko.

2
00:00:08,008 --> 00:00:09,009
Chiko.

3
00:00:09,801 --> 00:00:11,094
Chiko.

4
00:00:12,888 --> 00:00:14,473
-Chiko...
-[drunkard slurring]

5
00:00:14,556 --> 00:00:18,894
What's with you,
grinning and going "Chiko" nonstop?

6
00:00:18,977 --> 00:00:21,647
Sorry. I'm going on a date
with my girlfriend now.

7
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,440
-[drunkard] What did you say?
-[chuckles]

8
00:00:23,524 --> 00:00:25,692
[drunkard slurring]

9
00:00:26,276 --> 00:00:30,072
With all sorts of things happening
in this world, young people should--

10
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:32,783
Sorry, but I'm going on a date
with my girlfriend.

11
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:34,743
-Do it properly...
-There, there.

12
00:00:34,826 --> 00:00:36,954
-Stop it.
-Good boy.

13
00:00:37,037 --> 00:00:38,455
-I'll punch you in the face.
-[chuckles]

14
00:00:38,539 --> 00:00:40,415
-[drunkard slurring]
-Satoshi?

15
00:00:40,499 --> 00:00:41,959
Chiko!

16
00:00:45,671 --> 00:00:46,838
[laughs]

17
00:00:47,506 --> 00:00:49,424
-What's with your hair?
-Huh?

18
00:00:50,551 --> 00:00:51,635
Is it that weird?

19
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:53,553
[drunkard slurring]

20
00:00:55,639 --> 00:00:57,349
Why did you dye it like that?

21
00:00:57,849 --> 00:01:00,602
We'll look like a matching set.
That's embarrassing.

22
00:01:00,686 --> 00:01:02,145
Huh?

23
00:01:02,229 --> 00:01:05,107
[Chiko] You bleached it, right? [laughs]

24
00:01:05,190 --> 00:01:07,234
I'm gonna change it back right now.

25
00:01:07,317 --> 00:01:08,652
[Chiko] No, you don't have to.

26
00:01:08,735 --> 00:01:11,947
No... Bleached blond hair isn't for me!

27
00:01:12,531 --> 00:01:13,532
I'm blond too.

28
00:01:13,615 --> 00:01:15,909
No. It suits you.

29
00:01:15,993 --> 00:01:17,452
I've decided to change it back.

30
00:01:17,536 --> 00:01:21,039
[sighs] Then I'll dye it for you.
Let's go to Don Quijote.

31
00:01:22,374 --> 00:01:23,375
Huh?

32
00:01:24,543 --> 00:01:27,170
-Where will we do it?
-Where else? At your place.

33
00:01:28,755 --> 00:01:29,923
[Chiko] What?

34
00:01:34,511 --> 00:01:36,430
-Is that not okay?
-Not at all.

35
00:01:36,513 --> 00:01:38,265
You're very welcome!

36
00:01:39,766 --> 00:01:41,268
-Then let's go.
-[snorts]

37
00:01:44,354 --> 00:01:47,983
Oh, that's right.
Why don't you keep it as a memory?

38
00:01:49,067 --> 00:01:50,068
Your hair.

39
00:01:50,152 --> 00:01:52,487
[♪ light music playing]

40
00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:02,831
RED LIGHT ELEGY

41
00:02:04,416 --> 00:02:06,668
EPISODE 3

42
00:02:06,752 --> 00:02:07,753
[chuckles]

43
00:02:12,841 --> 00:02:14,468
[Satoshi groans] Oh, no.

44
00:02:17,763 --> 00:02:19,264
[Satoshi] You can come up now.

45
00:02:20,057 --> 00:02:21,058
[Chiko] Mm.

46
00:02:23,935 --> 00:02:25,604
[Satoshi] I live on the fourth floor.

47
00:02:26,313 --> 00:02:28,148
[Chiko] No elevator?

48
00:02:29,483 --> 00:02:31,485
[Satoshi] Uh... it's broken!

49
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:40,619
Maybe we should leave it for a while.

50
00:02:40,702 --> 00:02:42,329
-Thanks.
-Okay.

51
00:02:44,414 --> 00:02:46,416
-Can I smoke?
-Sure.

52
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:48,835
Ah, I'll get you something to drink.

53
00:02:48,919 --> 00:02:50,420
Do we even have an ashtray?

54
00:03:13,527 --> 00:03:15,070
[exclaims]

55
00:03:40,804 --> 00:03:42,806
[Satoshi yells] Damn! No!

56
00:03:42,889 --> 00:03:44,808
[spluttering] Well... this is... uh...

57
00:03:44,891 --> 00:03:46,977
These aren't actually mine!

58
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:49,187
My friend brought me a ton of them.

59
00:03:49,271 --> 00:03:52,065
-And I...
-Don't worry about it.

60
00:03:52,149 --> 00:03:53,567
No, but--

61
00:03:58,447 --> 00:04:00,115
Can I kiss you?

62
00:04:04,202 --> 00:04:05,579
I guess.

63
00:04:05,662 --> 00:04:07,998
[♪ soft music playing]

64
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:42,783
Well, Chiko... can I touch your chest?

65
00:04:43,825 --> 00:04:45,577
[Chiko] Stop asking every little thing!

66
00:04:49,498 --> 00:04:51,124
-[door clanks]
-[gasps]

67
00:04:51,583 --> 00:04:53,585
[Satoshi's brother]
Huh? The door's unlocked.

68
00:04:54,795 --> 00:04:56,129
Bro, you home?

69
00:04:57,964 --> 00:04:59,382
Come on in.

70
00:05:00,258 --> 00:05:02,219
-[Sayaka] What should I do, Yak-kun?
-[door closes]

71
00:05:02,302 --> 00:05:03,720
[Satoshi's brother] Just calm down!

72
00:05:04,262 --> 00:05:06,306
Bro, you back?

73
00:05:07,015 --> 00:05:08,225
Bro?

74
00:05:08,850 --> 00:05:10,769
-Bro?
-[Satoshi] Come on...

75
00:05:13,230 --> 00:05:15,565
Whoa, Bro. What's with that hair?

76
00:05:16,024 --> 00:05:17,859
Didn't you say you were going out?

77
00:05:19,194 --> 00:05:20,237
Who's this?

78
00:05:20,737 --> 00:05:22,864
Uh... [awkward chuckle]

79
00:05:22,948 --> 00:05:25,992
Uh... this is my brother, Yasushi.

80
00:05:26,076 --> 00:05:28,578
And his girlfriend, Sayaka.

81
00:05:28,662 --> 00:05:30,205
And this is...

82
00:05:30,831 --> 00:05:32,833
my girlfriend, Chiko.

83
00:05:33,583 --> 00:05:36,419
What? Your girlfriend?

84
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:38,922
-[Yasushi exclaims]
-Hi.

85
00:05:39,005 --> 00:05:41,424
-[crying]
-Come on...

86
00:05:41,508 --> 00:05:43,051
Sayaka, I told you not to cry.

87
00:05:43,134 --> 00:05:44,886
[crying continues]

88
00:05:47,764 --> 00:05:48,974
This one is...

89
00:05:49,057 --> 00:05:52,227
Preg... pregnancy, pregnancy...

90
00:05:55,397 --> 00:05:57,148
Let's do the test first.

91
00:05:58,525 --> 00:06:00,110
To the bathroom. Can you stand?

92
00:06:00,193 --> 00:06:02,362
[water flushing]

93
00:06:03,864 --> 00:06:05,782
[sobbing]

94
00:06:06,992 --> 00:06:08,326
I...

95
00:06:09,035 --> 00:06:10,996
I can't kill this baby.

96
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:14,541
But... we're both in high school.

97
00:06:14,624 --> 00:06:16,001
How can we raise a kid?

98
00:06:16,084 --> 00:06:18,336
How am I supposed to know?

99
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:19,963
So I said it's impossible!

100
00:06:20,046 --> 00:06:22,215
What choice do we have? Listen...

101
00:06:22,299 --> 00:06:24,301
Calm down, Sayaka!

102
00:06:24,384 --> 00:06:25,468
We can't make it.

103
00:06:25,552 --> 00:06:26,678
[Yasushi grunts]

104
00:06:28,054 --> 00:06:30,015
-[groans]
-[Sayaka] Yak-kun?

105
00:06:30,098 --> 00:06:34,436
If you're freaking out this much,
you shouldn't have slept together.

106
00:06:35,353 --> 00:06:36,354
[Yasushi groaning]

107
00:06:37,022 --> 00:06:38,565
You need to see a doctor too.

108
00:06:39,691 --> 00:06:42,152
[Chiko] Just calm down and talk it out.

109
00:06:43,403 --> 00:06:45,071
[engine idling]

110
00:06:50,994 --> 00:06:52,078
Oh.

111
00:06:56,791 --> 00:06:57,834
Whatever.

112
00:07:08,762 --> 00:07:10,805
I want to have Yak-kun's baby.

113
00:07:11,556 --> 00:07:13,266
I'm not going home.

114
00:07:17,354 --> 00:07:20,148
[mom] What do you think, Yasushi?

115
00:07:22,025 --> 00:07:25,570
For me... If that's what Sayaka wants...

116
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,533
Do whatever you want.

117
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:37,332
You can't live without money.
So get a job right away.

118
00:07:39,250 --> 00:07:41,586
I'm not taking responsibility.

119
00:07:44,214 --> 00:07:47,300
Mom! They're still in high school.

120
00:07:47,384 --> 00:07:49,010
You have to help them a little.

121
00:07:49,094 --> 00:07:51,596
[mom] We can't afford
any more mouths to feed.

122
00:07:52,597 --> 00:07:54,391
We can't do that.

123
00:07:57,143 --> 00:07:58,603
Your dad...

124
00:07:58,687 --> 00:08:03,441
worked like a horse for you all and died.

125
00:08:12,492 --> 00:08:16,162
-Then I'll move out!
-What?

126
00:08:21,209 --> 00:08:22,836
Do whatever you want.

127
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:27,048
[rental agent] Mr. Yanagawa,
you work for a security company?

128
00:08:27,132 --> 00:08:29,801
-Yes.
-[rental agent] I see. And...

129
00:08:29,884 --> 00:08:31,636
-A part-time job?
-Yes.

130
00:08:32,220 --> 00:08:35,223
Part-time. Hmm... Part-time.

131
00:08:36,808 --> 00:08:38,560
Part-time...

132
00:08:39,227 --> 00:08:42,272
[Chiko] Part-timers and full-timers
rent places too!

133
00:08:42,355 --> 00:08:45,525
You've got a guarantor.
Who do you think you are, old man?

134
00:08:45,608 --> 00:08:49,112
Is that how you ask
to rent someone's property?

135
00:08:49,195 --> 00:08:55,035
Besides, no one rents to people like you
who don't even work properly!

136
00:08:55,118 --> 00:08:57,037
I work my ass off!

137
00:08:57,120 --> 00:09:00,415
That's why I'm here
trying to rent a place, dumbass!

138
00:09:00,498 --> 00:09:02,542
-You don't look employed to me!
-Stop!

139
00:09:02,625 --> 00:09:06,671
-What part of us looks unemployed, huh?
-Chiko, stop! Thanks!

140
00:09:06,755 --> 00:09:08,214
I can tell from head to toe.

141
00:09:08,298 --> 00:09:11,384
How about you?
Look in the mirror, asshole!

142
00:09:13,511 --> 00:09:15,889
Unload everything first,
then sort it later.

143
00:09:15,972 --> 00:09:16,973
[Satoshi] Okay.

144
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,185
[Satoshi groans]

145
00:09:39,579 --> 00:09:40,914
It's hot.

146
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:48,588
Whew... [groans]

147
00:09:48,671 --> 00:09:51,007
-[Chiko] Let's get the next one.
-Sure.

148
00:09:57,555 --> 00:10:01,226
Wait... are you moving
into the unit upstairs?

149
00:10:01,309 --> 00:10:03,895
[Satoshi] Yes. I'm Yanagawa.

150
00:10:03,978 --> 00:10:06,815
-Hello. Nice to meet you.
-[Satoshi] Hello.

151
00:10:06,898 --> 00:10:10,652
-I'm Kiyobayashi, the manager. [chuckles]
-[Satoshi] I see.

152
00:10:10,735 --> 00:10:12,070
You two live together?

153
00:10:12,153 --> 00:10:14,155
-[Chiko] No.
-[Satoshi] No. Just me.

154
00:10:14,239 --> 00:10:16,199
-Really?
-[Satoshi] Yes.

155
00:10:17,158 --> 00:10:19,077
But you're a couple, right?

156
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:20,453
[Satoshi] Well... yes.

157
00:10:20,537 --> 00:10:23,581
Burnables are collected
Mondays and Fridays.

158
00:10:23,665 --> 00:10:26,167
Just put your trash out
between 6:30 and 7:30 a.m.

159
00:10:26,251 --> 00:10:28,503
No putting it out the night before.

160
00:10:28,586 --> 00:10:32,173
If you miss the deadline,
you'll have to take it back inside.

161
00:10:32,257 --> 00:10:34,425
-I see.
-There's a couple in Room 201,

162
00:10:34,509 --> 00:10:38,179
-named Yamashita and Mukai.
-[awkward chuckle]

163
00:10:38,263 --> 00:10:40,223
They're always late with the trash.

164
00:10:40,306 --> 00:10:43,351
They say Yamashita gets home late, but--

165
00:10:43,434 --> 00:10:45,937
Sorry, ma'am.
We've still got boxes to move.

166
00:10:46,020 --> 00:10:51,025
[laughs] Sorry, I got carried away.
Sorry, sorry.

167
00:10:56,447 --> 00:11:01,536
Ah, and one thing,
laundry disturbs the neighbors.

168
00:11:01,619 --> 00:11:03,079
Don't do that after 8:00 p.m.

169
00:11:03,663 --> 00:11:05,540
-Okay.
-I'm counting on you.

170
00:11:16,092 --> 00:11:21,097
[chuckles] That's Mom for you.
They sell this at any supermarket.

171
00:11:22,056 --> 00:11:23,433
[Chiko] True.

172
00:11:28,062 --> 00:11:30,940
TO SATOSHI

173
00:11:43,036 --> 00:11:45,038
I need a washing machine too.

174
00:11:45,121 --> 00:11:47,832
[Chiko] 8:00 p.m. is way too early
for laundry.

175
00:11:47,916 --> 00:11:49,042
[soft chuckle]

176
00:11:49,125 --> 00:11:51,794
-I know a cheap place. Let's go buy one.
-Okay.

177
00:11:56,841 --> 00:11:59,344
There's a room for your stuff too.

178
00:12:01,012 --> 00:12:02,180
Huh?

179
00:12:08,353 --> 00:12:09,395
Well...

180
00:12:10,647 --> 00:12:14,776
I might move in someday if I feel like it.

181
00:12:15,693 --> 00:12:16,694
What?

182
00:12:18,071 --> 00:12:20,865
Right, there's somewhere I wanna go.
Just come with me.

183
00:12:21,449 --> 00:12:22,450
Huh?

184
00:12:28,831 --> 00:12:31,918
ONION TEMPURA

185
00:12:32,710 --> 00:12:34,545
Let's grab some yakitori too.

186
00:12:48,601 --> 00:12:50,186
It was full of old guys.

187
00:12:50,270 --> 00:12:52,897
Give us 20 years, and we'll be the same.

188
00:12:52,981 --> 00:12:54,649
[chuckles]

189
00:12:55,692 --> 00:12:57,443
TAMADE SUPERMARKET

190
00:13:02,448 --> 00:13:04,492
-Chiko!
-Huh?

191
00:13:06,494 --> 00:13:07,829
Chiko...

192
00:13:07,912 --> 00:13:10,248
Why don't we live here together?

193
00:13:17,839 --> 00:13:20,508
No, that's not it.

194
00:13:20,591 --> 00:13:24,512
The landlord gave me two keys,
so I just thought I'd give you one.

195
00:13:25,513 --> 00:13:26,723
And...

196
00:13:26,806 --> 00:13:28,558
That's all. [awkward chuckle]

197
00:13:47,035 --> 00:13:48,327
[soft groan]

198
00:13:51,622 --> 00:13:54,125
[soft moaning]

199
00:13:56,836 --> 00:13:58,588
[exhales] Chiko...

200
00:14:00,006 --> 00:14:03,426
What am I gonna do without you?

201
00:14:08,056 --> 00:14:09,640
[Satoshi snoring]

202
00:14:48,096 --> 00:14:51,140
Seriously, knock it off.
I told you to stop!

203
00:14:51,224 --> 00:14:52,433
[cans clattering]

204
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:56,562
It's my money. What's wrong with that?

205
00:14:56,646 --> 00:14:59,774
-Let go of me.
-You're such a pain, damn it!

206
00:14:59,857 --> 00:15:00,858
[groans]

207
00:15:04,112 --> 00:15:05,738
Get the hell out of here!

208
00:15:05,822 --> 00:15:07,824
[♪ somber music playing]

209
00:15:09,826 --> 00:15:10,827
[tuts]

210
00:15:27,510 --> 00:15:29,095
Yu... Yusaku...

211
00:15:43,943 --> 00:15:45,361
Hmm?

212
00:15:45,945 --> 00:15:47,947
[♪ somber music continues]

213
00:16:06,048 --> 00:16:07,133
[Chiko sniffles]

214
00:16:11,012 --> 00:16:13,014
[Satoshi snoring]

215
00:16:15,183 --> 00:16:17,018
[birds chirping]

216
00:16:18,060 --> 00:16:19,187
[sharp inhale]

217
00:16:45,421 --> 00:16:46,547
[both] What?

218
00:16:47,465 --> 00:16:51,385
No way. You've got a... girlfriend?

219
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:55,306
Well, yeah. A girlfriend.

220
00:16:55,848 --> 00:16:58,351
[friend 1] Where? Where did you meet her?

221
00:16:59,644 --> 00:17:01,020
At work, kind of.

222
00:17:01,103 --> 00:17:03,773
[friend 1] No way you can get a girlfriend
as a security guard.

223
00:17:03,856 --> 00:17:06,317
Bet she's just plain and boring like you.

224
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:08,319
Yeah, absolutely.

225
00:17:08,402 --> 00:17:10,238
Your prejudice is insane.

226
00:17:10,321 --> 00:17:14,951
Actually, Chiko is beautiful, strong,
and a little too gorgeous.

227
00:17:15,034 --> 00:17:18,454
Beautiful? Why would a girl like that
date a guy like you?

228
00:17:18,537 --> 00:17:20,248
Yeah, that's true.

229
00:17:20,331 --> 00:17:24,126
You're so plain, spineless,
and still a virgin.

230
00:17:26,504 --> 00:17:29,006
[seller] Satoshi, your fries are ready.
Come get them.

231
00:17:29,090 --> 00:17:31,842
-I'm busy!
-Coming. [chuckles]

232
00:17:35,012 --> 00:17:37,515
-[friend 1] What's with him?
-[kid 1] The Lost Gen is over, right?

233
00:17:37,598 --> 00:17:39,684
-[kid 2] What's that?
-[friend 2] No way. Why him?

234
00:17:39,767 --> 00:17:41,018
[kid 1]
The generation with all the bad luck.

235
00:17:41,102 --> 00:17:44,188
[friend 2] Why does it have to be him?

236
00:17:44,272 --> 00:17:46,148
Hey, Shige. Check her out!

237
00:17:47,275 --> 00:17:50,570
[Shige] What's with her? She looks creepy.

238
00:17:50,653 --> 00:17:52,321
[friend 1] But she's really cute.

239
00:17:52,405 --> 00:17:54,365
[Shige] Yeah, you're right.

240
00:17:54,448 --> 00:17:56,701
-She's cute.
-Cute.

241
00:17:56,784 --> 00:17:57,994
Huh?

242
00:17:58,619 --> 00:17:59,704
-What?
-What?

243
00:18:00,288 --> 00:18:03,165
-[friend 1] Is she staring at us?
-[Shige] She is.

244
00:18:03,249 --> 00:18:04,250
She's coming over.

245
00:18:04,333 --> 00:18:05,668
-Is she? Why?
-Yeah.

246
00:18:05,751 --> 00:18:07,253
[friend 1] Dunno, but here she comes.

247
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,839
[♪ quirky music playing]

248
00:18:15,386 --> 00:18:16,429
Hey.

249
00:18:19,599 --> 00:18:20,766
-[chair clanks]
-Hey.

250
00:18:22,977 --> 00:18:24,186
-[loudly] Hey.
-[gasps]

251
00:18:26,147 --> 00:18:27,898
[Chiko] What are you looking at?

252
00:18:27,982 --> 00:18:30,776
-Well... Nothing...
-Right.

253
00:18:30,860 --> 00:18:32,612
-Just nothing.
-No looking.

254
00:18:32,695 --> 00:18:33,779
[Chiko tuts]

255
00:18:36,782 --> 00:18:39,243
Oh... Chiko!

256
00:18:39,327 --> 00:18:40,870
Satoshi.

257
00:18:40,953 --> 00:18:42,079
[friends] What?

258
00:18:43,581 --> 00:18:45,082
I didn't mean it.

259
00:18:45,791 --> 00:18:48,544
[Chiko] I was just pissed off
after a fight with my mom.

260
00:18:49,086 --> 00:18:51,172
-I got it.
-I'm sorry.

261
00:18:53,466 --> 00:18:55,718
Something came up. I need to go.

262
00:18:55,801 --> 00:18:57,762
Oh, really?

263
00:18:58,387 --> 00:19:02,683
Well... I just wanted you
to meet these two.

264
00:19:03,434 --> 00:19:06,020
[slurping]

265
00:19:07,313 --> 00:19:08,522
-See ya.
-Yeah.

266
00:19:10,775 --> 00:19:13,778
[footsteps receding]

267
00:19:21,827 --> 00:19:23,412
[camera shutter clicking]

268
00:19:24,830 --> 00:19:26,332
What are you doing?

269
00:19:28,626 --> 00:19:32,254
-Are you sure she isn't a scammer?
-What?

270
00:19:32,338 --> 00:19:34,507
If you touch her, will you end up working

271
00:19:34,590 --> 00:19:36,801
in some remote mine until you die?

272
00:19:36,884 --> 00:19:40,179
Stop talking about Chiko
like she's some human trafficker!

273
00:19:40,262 --> 00:19:41,430
So...

274
00:19:42,264 --> 00:19:44,975
have you slept with her--

275
00:19:45,059 --> 00:19:46,060
[yelps]

276
00:19:47,353 --> 00:19:49,188
-[awkward chuckle]
-[Shige] My goodness.

277
00:19:49,271 --> 00:19:51,774
No, not yet.

278
00:19:52,692 --> 00:19:55,194
She's never stayed over at my place.

279
00:19:55,277 --> 00:19:57,113
-[friend 1] Even though you're dating?
-Yeah.

280
00:19:57,196 --> 00:20:00,157
[friend 1]
You sure she's not hiding something?

281
00:20:00,241 --> 00:20:01,659
Of course not.

282
00:20:06,372 --> 00:20:07,915
I've gotta get to work.

283
00:20:08,582 --> 00:20:10,167
See ya.

284
00:20:10,251 --> 00:20:12,128
-[Shige] Sure.
-Good luck, boy.

285
00:20:12,211 --> 00:20:14,296
-Okay.
-[Satoshi laughs]

286
00:20:18,592 --> 00:20:21,595
5,000 yen says
they break up within a month.

287
00:20:21,679 --> 00:20:23,848
10,000 yen says they don't last two weeks.

288
00:20:37,653 --> 00:20:39,905
Hey, Chiko. Good to see you.

289
00:20:39,989 --> 00:20:41,741
Hey.

290
00:20:41,824 --> 00:20:42,825
Why did you come?

291
00:20:43,951 --> 00:20:45,077
Because you called me.

292
00:20:45,161 --> 00:20:46,162
Right!

293
00:20:46,245 --> 00:20:49,165
Um... only you can do this.

294
00:20:50,291 --> 00:20:52,042
-Should be fine.
-Hmm?

295
00:20:59,425 --> 00:21:02,178
A mobile suit made just for you.

296
00:21:03,596 --> 00:21:04,722
Hmm?

297
00:21:05,848 --> 00:21:08,309
[Inaba] Here. Red bean rice.

298
00:21:08,392 --> 00:21:09,977
-Go.
-Huh?

299
00:21:10,060 --> 00:21:12,688
Thought your big day might be soon.

300
00:21:12,772 --> 00:21:15,065
Mr. Inaba, this is too much.

301
00:21:15,149 --> 00:21:17,985
Let's make today
the anniversary of losing your virginity.

302
00:21:18,068 --> 00:21:22,072
I know that you've been holding it in
for so long.

303
00:21:22,907 --> 00:21:23,949
Just eat.

304
00:21:25,493 --> 00:21:26,535
[phone chimes]

305
00:21:30,790 --> 00:21:32,124
[CHIKO] CAN I COME OVER TODAY?

306
00:21:32,208 --> 00:21:33,542
-[Inaba] Who?
-From Chiko.

307
00:21:33,626 --> 00:21:35,920
-What did she say?
-"Can I come over today?"

308
00:21:36,545 --> 00:21:37,797
Way to go.

309
00:21:38,798 --> 00:21:41,175
-You're a prophet.
-[laughs]

310
00:21:42,259 --> 00:21:44,595
[♪ soft music playing]

311
00:22:21,340 --> 00:22:23,092
[screaming]

312
00:22:23,175 --> 00:22:24,927
[laughing]

313
00:22:25,469 --> 00:22:27,346
Tissues! Tissues!

314
00:22:27,429 --> 00:22:29,598
How many did you use?

315
00:22:29,682 --> 00:22:31,016
-I'm dying.
-Sorry.

316
00:22:31,100 --> 00:22:33,227
No! Anything but that.

317
00:22:35,271 --> 00:22:38,148
[Chiko]
I'm thinking of working at a snack bar

318
00:22:38,232 --> 00:22:40,734
until a delivery company hires me.

319
00:22:41,902 --> 00:22:43,863
Hiro got me a job.

320
00:22:44,655 --> 00:22:46,156
A snack bar?

321
00:22:46,866 --> 00:22:51,161
I'm not sure about that.

322
00:22:55,457 --> 00:22:59,128
Looks like we're gonna need money
for all sorts of things.

323
00:23:01,630 --> 00:23:02,882
[exclaims]

324
00:23:02,965 --> 00:23:04,133
Oh, right.

325
00:23:05,843 --> 00:23:07,845
Here, I'll return this.

326
00:23:08,304 --> 00:23:10,306
[shocked gasp]

327
00:23:11,307 --> 00:23:12,683
Are you kidding?

328
00:23:13,267 --> 00:23:15,102
[exclaims excitedly]

329
00:23:15,644 --> 00:23:16,645
Wanna go somewhere?

330
00:23:16,729 --> 00:23:18,606
This room is dull. Maybe a hotel--

331
00:23:18,689 --> 00:23:20,482
Way too fast!

332
00:23:20,566 --> 00:23:22,067
That's not what I meant.

333
00:23:23,652 --> 00:23:25,821
[Chiko] But let's make it, to a hotel!

334
00:23:26,488 --> 00:23:27,573
[Satoshi] Yes, sir!

335
00:23:27,656 --> 00:23:28,991
[footsteps]

336
00:23:46,008 --> 00:23:50,930
[OSAKA'S TOP FOOD PICK]
TAMADE SUPERMARKET'S PREPARED DISHES

337
00:23:51,013 --> 00:23:53,098
[Chiko] Anything else you want?

338
00:23:54,016 --> 00:23:55,935
[Satoshi] Mm...

339
00:23:56,018 --> 00:23:58,479
No, that might be all right.

340
00:24:01,273 --> 00:24:02,775
[Chiko] Let's go then.

341
00:24:02,858 --> 00:24:05,277
[♪ closing theme music playing]
